<title>FINLAND: Kemira four-mth sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Kemira four-mth sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy on Monday gave the following breakdown by division of its January-April results (million markka).</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	 Jan-April '97	 Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Kemira Chemicals	     132		    150</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments		-48		     22</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		    303		    422</p>
<p> Tikkurila			 99		     60</p>
<p> Other 1)			 -13		    -28</p>
<p> TOTAL			    473		    626</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>NET SALES  Kemira Chemicals	   1,092		    983</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments		744		    699</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		  2,510		  2,467</p>
<p> Tikkurila			645		    482</p>
<p> Other 1)			 347		    396</p>
<p> Intra-group sales	   -209		   -202</p>
<p> TOTAL			  5,129		 13,471</p>
<p>1) Includes other businesses, group administration and eliminations from operating income.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
